      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🚨 Shared Error Handler — one failure notifier for every workflow\nAn Error Trigger workflow wired into every other workflow's *Settings → Error Workflow*. When any workflow fails in production, n8n routes the failure here → it formats a readable alert (which workflow, which node, the error, a deep link to the failed run) → emails it instantly. Build it once, wire it everywhere.\n**n8n · Gmail**",
