    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3 · Notify by email\nGmail sends the alert instantly, with the workflow name in the subject so failures are triageable straight from the inbox. Swap Gmail for Slack/Telegram to change channel — the rest of the chain is unchanged.",
